# An allowlist: the image needs pyproject.toml, uv.lock, README.md and src/ only, so anything
# added to the repo later stays out of the build context unless it is named here.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
# Inside src/ too: never a .env (it can hold provider keys and set the API's auth mode,
# docs/ingest.md), a key file or bytecode.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.key
**/__pycache__/
